        "color": "amber",
        "collapsed": false,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 150,
        "body": "One age drives the heart-rate cards: **Max Heart Rate** (Tanaka's 208 − 0.7 × age), the **Karvonen** target at 70% effort, and the five training **zones**. **BMR** estimates the energy a body uses at rest, and **TDEE** scales it by activity. These are population formulas: a guide, not a diagnosis.",
        "fieldTypes": {}
      }
    },
